        on: "prestart",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "dialog",
            value: "no",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_12",
        on: "branch_if_12",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "sceptre",
            equals: "Konrad",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("I thank you for helping me get back to the surface, but now I must take what is mine!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("You still want to fight me, do you, Li’sar?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Did you think I was just playing around? I need to take my inheritance!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("It is not so simple! We are back on the surface, but we are hardly safe. We barely know where we are. Look to the north... there are orcs about! Look to the south... there are hordes of undead!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Indeed there are. We shall have to fight our way out. Are you with us or against us?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Perhaps it is in both our best interests for us to remain allies for a little longer... but I do want that Sceptre, and someday I shall have it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Then let us devise a battle plan."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_13",
        on: "branch_if_13",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "sceptre",
            not_equals: "Konrad",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("We have escaped."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Yes, we have. Now I suppose you want to use the Sceptre against me, Li’sar?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("No, I was thinking... I don’t really want to kill you. I have what I came to get. So if you promise never to come south of the Great River, I will spare your life."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("With all due respect, <i>Princess</i>, it is once again we who will spare you, Sceptre or no Sceptre."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("Such words in the presence of royalty! Do you want me to fry you, Elf?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Friends, peace! Though we are out of the tunnels, we are hardly safe. We are somewhere in the arid and wild north lands, that is all we know. Behold! To the north, orcs, to the south, dark hordes. We must remain at peace with one another, or else all perish!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("I suppose that helping each other for a while longer would be mutually beneficial. But what should we do? How should we defend ourselves?"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_12",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_13",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("I can tell where we are. That is the river that is known as Longlier to men, called Arkan-thoria in my people’s ancient tongue. The home of my people lies to the east."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Then perhaps we should head east along the river, and seek refuge and rest there for a time?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("We should indeed seek refuge there, my lord, but not by going east along the river. Its name means ‘The River of Bones’. Great and evil creatures lurk along its banks, its waters are not fit to drink, and it runs over the Cliffs of Thoria. It has been many centuries since any man or elf has passed over the Cliffs and survived. No, Prince, we must choose another way."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("But which way, Kalenz?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("We may take two paths which avoid the river. North, through the ancient home of my people, and then east to where they now live. Or we can go south, passing through the swamps, before turning east and then north. We would cross the river one time more if we chose that route, but I know a safe place for the crossing."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("And will you join us in seeking refuge with the North Elves, Li’sar?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("If the elves will promise me refuge and safe passage, then I will go."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("That we will. Even though you are the daughter of the Queen, our enemy, we shall not harm you on this encounter, for you have helped us."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("So, we must choose. To the north past the orcs, where lie the ancient snow plains of the elves, or to the south, beyond the armies of the Walking Dead where the dreaded swamps await."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_16",
        on: "branch_if_16",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "via_isle_of_the_damned",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Loyal merfolk, you have served far beyond what your debt of gratitude requires. I will trust your strength and loyalty through this tribulation even as you trusted us to lead you through the heart of a volcano."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_17",
        on: "branch_if_17",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "via_isle_of_the_damned",
            equals: "yes",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_15",
        on: "branch_if_15",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "dialog",
            equals: "no",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Prince Konrad, you need not avoid the Arkan-thoria. We merfolk can lead you downstream; with our vanguard, your company will vanquish any foe, and reach the home of the North Elves much sooner than by either of the land routes. I can not promise a perilless journey, but it is an option for you to consider, my lord."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_16",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_17",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("If you are confident you can navigate these waters and guide our forces to safety, then lead on."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I am, my liege. We press ahead. Stay close, noble masters."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("I suspected you would attempt to lead us down the banks of Longlier..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("(shock) What!? Konrad, your folly is appalling! Do you flout my advice?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Li'sar",
            text: _("We are traveling east? Down the river? Konrad, I hope you know what you are committing us to."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Of course not, whelp, else he would have chosen a safer route."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            portrait: "portraits/konrad-human-concerned.webp",
            text: _("Hold your tongue, Kalenz. The Princess is our ally and of royal blood. She deserves not your disrespect."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("Delfador, you cannot allow this to happen! We march to our death!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Lord elf, I am in command. I have held council with the merfolk, and they believe they can find a path down the river and over the falls. We will take the most direct route to your homeland and escape the grasp of the Northerner armies that swarm the wilderness."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("(sigh) I have been spoiled by years of genteel living among your kind, Kalenz. An elf’s capacity for introspection and serenity is exceeded only by his ferocity and passion in battle."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            portrait: "portraits/delfador-mentoring.webp",
            text: _("It offends your pride and wisdom to suffer the indignity of accepting the will of humans, especially in such a harsh predicament. I urge you to remember how far we have come under Konrad’s leadership, and how close we are to bringing the hammer of destiny crashing down on Queen Asheviere’s ill-gotten throne. We will journey east."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kalenz",
            text: _("I do not like this, old friend. There are legends of things dwelling on this river that even I dare not speak of..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "dialog",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14_opt0",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "set_variable",
            name: "__next_scenario",
            value: "heir-to-the-throne-classic-19c",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14_opt1",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("As you say, my lord."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("If you want to choose the river path later, move a merman to the right end of the river again."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_14",
        on: "moveto",
        once: false,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 37,
            y: "27-28",
          },
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22event%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22moveto%22%2C%22first_time_only%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22if%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22dialog%22%2C%22equals%22%3A%22no%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22then%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Prince%20Konrad%2C%20you%20need%20not%20avoid%20the%20Arkan-thoria.%20We%20merfolk%20can%20lead%20you%20downstream%3B%20with%20our%20vanguard%2C%20your%20company%20will%20vanquish%20any%20foe%2C%20and%20reach%20the%20home%20of%20the%20North%20Elves%20much%20sooner%20than%20by%20either%20of%20the%20land%20routes.%20I%20can%20not%20promise%20a%20perilless%20journey%2C%20but%20it%20is%20an%20option%20for%20you%20to%20consider%2C%20my%20lord.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22if%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22via_isle_of_the_damned%22%2C%22not_equals%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22then%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Konrad%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Loyal%20merfolk%2C%20you%20have%20served%20far%20beyond%20what%20your%20debt%20of%20gratitude%20requires.%20I%20will%20trust%20your%20strength%20and%20loyalty%20through%20this%20tribulation%20even%20as%20you%20trusted%20us%20to%20lead%20you%20through%20the%20heart%20of%20a%20volcano.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22else%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22if%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22have_unit%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22%24unit.id%22%2C%22gender%22%3A%22male%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22then%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Konrad%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Your%20people%20have%20already%20saved%20me%20once%20from%20a%20watery%20death%2C%20noble%20merman%2C%20fighting%20by%20my%20side%20as%20undead%20horrors%20threatened%20to%20devour%20us.%20I%20entrust%20our%20army%20to%20your%20strength%20and%20protection.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22else%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Konrad%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Your%20people%20have%20already%20saved%20me%20once%20from%20a%20watery%20death%2C%20noble%20mermaid%2C%20fighting%20by%20my%20side%20as%20undead%20horrors%20threatened%20to%20devour%20us.%20I%20entrust%20our%20army%20to%20your%20strength%20and%20protection.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Konrad%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22If%20you%20are%20confident%20you%20can%20navigate%20these%20waters%20and%20guide%20our%20forces%20to%20safety%2C%20then%20lead%20on.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%20am%2C%20my%20liege.%20We%20press%20ahead.%20Stay%20close%2C%20noble%20masters.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Delfador%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%20suspected%20you%20would%20attempt%20to%20lead%20us%20down%20the%20banks%20of%20Longlier...%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Kalenz%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22(shock)%20What!%3F%20Konrad%2C%20your%20folly%20is%20appalling!%20Do%20you%20flout%20my%20advice%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Li'sar%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22We%20are%20traveling%20east%3F%20Down%20the%20river%3F%20Konrad%2C%20I%20hope%20you%20know%20what%20you%20are%20committing%20us%20to.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Kalenz%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Of%20course%20not%2C%20whelp%2C%20else%20he%20would%20have%20chosen%20a%20safer%20route.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Konrad%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22portraits%2Fkonrad-human-concerned.webp%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Hold%20your%20tongue%2C%20Kalenz.%20The%20Princess%20is%20our%20ally%20and%20of%20royal%20blood.%20She%20deserves%20not%20your%20disrespect.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Kalenz%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Delfador%2C%20you%20cannot%20allow%20this%20to%20happen!%20We%20march%20to%20our%20death!%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Konrad%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Lord%20elf%2C%20I%20am%20in%20command.%20I%20have%20held%20council%20with%20the%20merfolk%2C%20and%20they%20believe%20they%20can%20find%20a%20path%20down%20the%20river%20and%20over%20the%20falls.%20We%20will%20take%20the%20most%20direct%20route%20to%20your%20homeland%20and%20escape%20the%20grasp%20of%20the%20Northerner%20armies%20that%20swarm%20the%20wilderness.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Delfador%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22portraits%2Fdelfador-mentoring.webp%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22(sigh)%20I%20have%20been%20spoiled%20by%20years%20of%20genteel%20living%20among%20your%20kind%2C%20Kalenz.%20An%20elf%E2%80%99s%20capacity%20for%20introspection%20and%20serenity%20is%20exceeded%20only%20by%20his%20ferocity%20and%20passion%20in%20battle.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Delfador%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22portraits%2Fdelfador-mentoring.webp%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22It%20offends%20your%20pride%20and%20wisdom%20to%20suffer%20the%20indignity%20of%20accepting%20the%20will%20of%20humans%2C%20especially%20in%20such%20a%20harsh%20predicament.%20I%20urge%20you%20to%20remember%20how%20far%20we%20have%20come%20under%20Konrad%E2%80%99s%20leadership%2C%20and%20how%20close%20we%20are%20to%20bringing%20the%20hammer%20of%20destiny%20crashing%20down%20on%20Queen%20Asheviere%E2%80%99s%20ill-gotten%20throne.%20We%20will%20journey%20east.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Kalenz%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%20do%20not%20like%20this%2C%20old%20friend.%20There%20are%20legends%20of%20things%20dwelling%20on%20this%20river%20that%20even%20I%20dare%20not%20speak%20of...%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22set_variable%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22name%22%3A%22dialog%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22yes%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22Prince%20Konrad%2C%20are%20you%20sure%20you%20want%20to%20do%20this%3F%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22Konrad%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22I%20say%20that...%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22option%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22label%22%3A%22Our%20need%20for%20speed%20outweighs%20the%20danger.%20With%20the%20merfolk%20to%20help%20us%2C%20we%20will%20win%20through.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22command%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22role%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22role%22%3A%22merman-advisor%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22%24unit.id%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22endlevel%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22next_scenario%22%3A%2219c_Cliffs_of_Thoria%22%2C%22result%22%3A%22victory%22%2C%22bonus%22%3A%22yes%22%2C%22carryover_add%22%3A%22yes%22%2C%22carryover_percentage%22%3A%2240%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22option%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22label%22%3A%22On%20second%20thought%2C%20perhaps%20we%20should%20choose%20a%20safer%20way%20to%20go.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22command%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22unit%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22As%20you%20say%2C%20my%20lord.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%2C%7B%22tag%22%3A%22message%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22speaker%22%3A%22narrator%22%2C%22image%22%3A%22wesnoth-icon.png%22%2C%22message%22%3A%22If%20you%20want%20to%20choose%20the%20river%20path%20later%2C%20move%20a%20merman%20to%20the%20right%20end%20of%20the%20river%20again.%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
